Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Transform functions are recognized by their full name, so
 tomato(1) or sale(2) throws expectedFunction instead of parsing as translate
 or scale (swift-w3c/swift-w3c-svg#11)

---
 .../W3C_SVG2.Types.Transform.Parse.swift      | 45 +++++++-------
 ...W3C_SVG2.Types.Transform.Parse Tests.swift | 58 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 79 insertions(+), 24 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 Tests/W3C SVG Tests/W3C_SVG2.Types.Transform.Parse Tests.swift

diff --git a/Sources/W3C SVG/W3C_SVG2.Types.Transform.Parse.swift b/Sources/W3C SVG/W3C_SVG2.Types.Transform.Parse.swift
